  "destinationNote": "expect.files is populated ONLY where references/INDEX.md names the destination unambiguously (GQ-06, GQ-03, GQ-09, GQ-42). Everywhere else the reference rows assert that the skill won retrieval and, for a bare symptom, that this session was not audited. Asserting a destination we cannot justify would be a fixture that measures nothing.",
  "declineNote": "Rows expecting kind=decline are questions where NOT invoking the skill is correct. They were selected as low-scoring, but they scored low because they are off-topic or undocumented, not because routing failed. Requiring the skill to win on them would reward over-triggering, which is the primary risk of this change, so they now assert the opposite and measure that risk directly.",
